Package: krellix
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: krellix-server
Description: Themeable Qt 6 system monitor in the spirit of GKrellM
 Krellix is a desktop system monitor displaying CPU, memory, disk, network,
 temperature sensors, uptime, and more. It supports themes and a plugin
 architecture for extensibility.
 .
 Features include color-coded thermal sensor display (green/warn/red),
 Fahrenheit/Celsius toggle, and configurable display modes.

Package: krellix-server
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: krellixd — remote monitoring daemon for krellix
 The krellixd daemon exposes system metrics over TCP so that krellix
 can monitor remote hosts. Configure it on the host to watch and point
 krellix at it with --host.

Package: krellix-krellbluetooth
Architecture: any
Depends: krellix (>= 0.1.2-10), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, bluez
Description: Compact KrellBT Bluetooth monitor plugin for Krellix
 Shows connected local Bluetooth devices and available battery percentages.
 Uses the current theme and remains disabled until enabled in Settings.
